    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710110/extras/b9918bbd29c1b3df8f47a00b382dd4c4.poster.avif?t=1731274328\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710110/extras/b9918bbd29c1b3df8f47a00b382dd4c4.webm?t=1731274328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710110/extras/b9918bbd29c1b3df8f47a00b382dd4c4.mp4?t=1731274328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Bad Boro is a 2D souls-like action RPG focusing on exploration and challenging twin-stick melee combat. The game is set in the fictional city Badlerboro, which has been designed with gritty urban aesthetics, cartoons of our childhood, and our home town of NYC in mind. The game brings you fast paced combat, intense boss fights, and a nuanced story set in a lore-rich world. Every single visual asset and animation frame frame had been hand drawn in our stylized, early 2000\u2019s cartoon inspired, art style.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710110/extras/b9918bbd29c1b3df8f47a00b382dd4c4.poster.avif?t=1731274328\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710110/extras/b9918bbd29c1b3df8f47a00b382dd4c4.webm?t=1731274328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710110/extras/b9918bbd29c1b3df8f47a00b382dd4c4.mp4?t=1731274328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Bad Boro is a 2D souls-like action RPG focusing on exploration and challenging twin-stick melee combat. The game is set in the fictional city Badlerboro, which has been designed with gritty urban aesthetics, cartoons of our childhood, and our home town of NYC in mind. The game brings you fast paced combat, intense boss fights, and a nuanced story set in a lore-rich world. Every single visual asset and animation frame frame had been hand drawn in our stylized, early 2000\u2019s cartoon inspired, art style.",
    "short_description": "Ever imagine a Souls-like set in an early 2000\u2019s cartoon world? Well, look no further: Explore the cartoony &amp; dystopian city of Badlerboro with its unique districts, wacky citizens, and unforgiving enemies.",
